{"5018630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brawlzerker", "steam_appid": 5018630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brawlzerker throws you and up to three friends into a brutal, wave-based brawler built for the couch. Pick a hero, drop into the arena, and fight your way through escalating waves of enemies,  solo or with a full squad of four.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  No one gets left waiting. Drop-in multiplayer means a friend can join mid-fight at any time: press a button, cycle through the hero roster in a quick corner picker, confirm, and they're in the  action. No lobby, no pause, no interruption to the players already fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Between waves, survivors head to the shop to gear up. Spend your earnings across loot, weapons, items, and stat upgrades — including a gacha-style loot pull for a chance at something powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Every player resolves their own offers and readies up independently, so the pace between rounds is as frantic or as careful as your group wants it to be. The moment everyone's ready, it's  back into the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  With a growing hero roster, run-to-run loot variance, and the freedom to add or lose players on the fly, every session plays out differently. Whether you're grinding solo or piling four  controllers onto one couch, Brawlzerker is built for chaotic, competitive, &quot;one more wave&quot; co-op.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brawlzerker throws you and up to three friends into a brutal, wave-based brawler built for the couch. Pick a hero, drop into the arena, and fight your way through escalating waves of enemies,  solo or with a full squad of four.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  No one gets left waiting. Drop-in multiplayer means a friend can join mid-fight at any time: press a button, cycle through the hero roster in a quick corner picker, confirm, and they're in the  action. No lobby, no pause, no interruption to the players already fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Between waves, survivors head to the shop to gear up. Spend your earnings across loot, weapons, items, and stat upgrades — including a gacha-style loot pull for a chance at something powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Every player resolves their own offers and readies up independently, so the pace between rounds is as frantic or as careful as your group wants it to be. The moment everyone's ready, it's  back into the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  With a growing hero roster, run-to-run loot variance, and the freedom to add or lose players on the fly, every session plays out differently. Whether you're grinding solo or piling four  controllers onto one couch, Brawlzerker is built for chaotic, competitive, &quot;one more wave&quot; co-op.</p>", "short_description": "Local 4-player couch co-op brawler. Fight through chaotic waves, drop in anytime, then gear up between rounds — gamble on gacha loot, grab new weapons, and build your stats before the next fight hits.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5018630/9303477c073adb69afa0c9d33c3e0f1db2797aab/header.jpg?t=1787337521", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5018630/7f030b956a8b90a54b186957a19a123486512d7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787337521", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5018630/7f030b956a8b90a54b186957a19a123486512d7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787337521", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (1909 or later)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</st